.TH "nvme_init_set_features_host_mgmt_agent_addr" 9 "nvme_init_set_features_host_mgmt_agent_addr" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_set_features_host_mgmt_agent_addr \- Initialize passthru command for Host Management Agent Address
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_set_features_host_mgmt_agent_addr
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "bool sv "  ","
.BI "void *data "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sv" 12
Save value across power states
.IP "data" 12
512 byte Host Management Agent Address (HMAA) data buffer,
see \fIstruct nvme_mgmt_addr_desc\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Set Features command with
FID value NVME_FEAT_FID_HOST_MGMT_AGENT_ADDR
